    "whatItIs": "respond.io is an omnichannel customer messaging platform: WhatsApp Business API plus other messaging channels in a shared team inbox, with workflows, broadcasts, AI Assist/Agents and contact-based packaging. Confirmed on respond.io/pricing 2026-08-17: Starter $79, Growth $159, Advanced $279 per month on the yearly toggle ($948 / $1,908 / $3,348 billed yearly), with Enterprise custom. Pricing scales with monthly active contacts (MAC) tiers. 7-day free trial, no credit card. Scored in the customer-messaging cluster as a Wati peer — not ranked against phone systems.",
